use commerce
# The agreement again, each keyword and word in any of the three languages.
contract Agreement
訂約方 we, 客户

thing Terms
  terms 文字
  amount 港元
  starts date

can amend 由 本公司 with new_amount HKD, new_start 日期
  須 proposed
  requires 經 customer 同意
  须 new_amount > HKD 0
  如 new_amount > 金額 * 150%
    reject "an amendment may raise the amount by half at most"
  否則
    amount = new_amount
  starts = new_start
可 sign by 客戶
  over 1_000_000 須親身確認
  requires now < starts
  已提議 -> signed
can countersign 由 we
  signed -> effective
可 close by 本公司
  须 经 客户 同意
  effective -> closed

test "signed in person, countersigned, and closed"
  we 建立 at 2026-10-14 連同 terms = "100 t of steel, monthly", amount = 港元 1_500_000, starts = 2027-01-01
  本公司 amend with new_amount = HKD 2_000_000, new_start = 2027-01-08 -> 已提议
  customer sign -> 被拒絕 "bo:in-person sign"
  客户 sign 親身確認 -> signed
  we amend 附带 new_amount = HKD 1, new_start = 2027-01-08 -> refused "bo:requires amend 1"
  本公司 countersign -> effective
  we close 时间 2027-06-30 -> closed
  we close -> 被拒绝

測試 "what one party cannot do alone"
  本公司 create with terms = "100 t of steel, monthly", amount = HKD 500_000, starts = 2027-01-01
  we amend with new_amount = 港元 600_000, new_start = 2027-01-01 -> 經 客户 同意
  we amend with new_amount = HKD 900_000, new_start = 2027-01-01
  -> 被拒絕 "an amendment may raise the amount by half at most"
  we sign -> consent of 客戶
  客户 countersign -> refused "bo:state countersign"
  customer sign 由 AI 代理 -> signed
  客戶 countersign -> 经 we 同意
  本公司 close -> refused "bo:state close"

测试 "too late to sign"
  we 创建 with terms = "100 t of steel, monthly", 金額 = HKD 500_000, starts = 2027-01-01
  customer sign 時間 2027-01-02 -> 被拒绝 "bo:requires sign 2"
